{"id":"324aa8987ee8eac3","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-genmltest.md","title":"广义 Martin-Löf 检验","display":"df-genmltest — 广义 Martin-Löf 检验","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-genmltest","aliases":["43-df-genmltest"],"display":"df-genmltest — 广义 Martin-Löf 检验","depends_on":["[[43-df-cylinder]]","[[43-df-effective-open]]","[[43-df-measure]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§9.3.2 strong randomness讨论，印刷178，PDF198；§10.5.1，印刷236–237，PDF256–257","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-genmltest"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-genmltest</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-genmltest — 广义 Martin-Löf 检验"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7d3f8d3dfdb54f27\" href=\"?note=7d3f8d3dfdb54f27\" title=\"43-df-effective-open\">43-df-effective-open</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8e999d59227f4a28\" href=\"?note=8e999d59227f4a28\" title=\"43-df-measure\">43-df-measure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§9.3.2 strong randomness讨论，印刷178，PDF198；§10.5.1，印刷236–237，PDF256–257"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\">\\(\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a> 的 Borel σ 代数。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>；统一有效开见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7d3f8d3dfdb54f27\" href=\"?note=7d3f8d3dfdb54f27\" title=\"43-df-effective-open\">43-df-effective-open</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a> 的公平硬币 Borel 概率测度。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GenMLTest}\">\\(\\mathrm{GenMLTest}\\)</span> 是开集序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，以下Assertion给出其定义。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniformEffectiveOpen}\">\\(\\mathrm{UniformEffectiveOpen}\\)</span> 是序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，统一性指一个c.e.关系同时编码全部分量，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7d3f8d3dfdb54f27\" href=\"?note=7d3f8d3dfdb54f27\" title=\"43-df-effective-open\">43-df-effective-open</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GenMLTest}(U)\\iff\\exists V\\in\\mathcal B^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(U=V\\land\\mathrm{UniformEffectiveOpen}(V)\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\ge N\\;\\mu(V_n)\\le2^{-k}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{GenMLTest}(U)\\iff\\exists V\\in\\mathcal B^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(U=V\\land\\mathrm{UniformEffectiveOpen}(V)\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\ge N\\;\\mu(V_n)\\le2^{-k}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>检验以同值 Borel 序列 V 作见证，保留原输入签名；不合格的任意集合序列也不会触发 μ 或 ν 的越域调用。</p>\n<p>允许没有可计算的测度收敛速度。取有限交后也可要求递减。</p>\n<p>来源：§9.3.2 strong randomness讨论，印刷178，PDF198；§10.5.1，印刷236–237，PDF256–257。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-cylinder]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effective-open","status":"resolved","id":"7d3f8d3dfdb54f27","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-effective-open]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-measure","status":"resolved","id":"8e999d59227f4a28","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)$ 是 [[43-df-cylinder]] 的 Borel σ 代数。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effective-open","status":"resolved","id":"7d3f8d3dfdb54f27","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}$；统一有效开见 [[43-df-effective-open]]；$\\mu$ 为 [[43-df-cylinder]] 的公平硬币 Borel 概率测度。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}$；统一有效开见 [[43-df-effective-open]]；$\\mu$ 为 [[43-df-cylinder]] 的公平硬币 Borel 概率测度。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effective-open","status":"resolved","id":"7d3f8d3dfdb54f27","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GenMLTest}$ 是开集序列 $\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}$ 上的布尔谓词，以下Assertion给出其定义。\n$\\mathrm{UniformEffectiveOpen}$ 是序列 $U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}$ 上的布尔谓词，统一性指一个c.e.关系同时编码全部分量，见 [[43-df-effective-open]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GenMLTest}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UniformEffectiveOpen}","display":false},{"tex":"U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GenMLTest}(U)\\iff\\exists V\\in\\mathcal B^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(U=V\\land\\mathrm{UniformEffectiveOpen}(V)\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\ge N\\;\\mu(V_n)\\le2^{-k}\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1829,"backlinks":[{"id":"1a145b88092ce22e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\mathrm{GenMLTest}$ 见 [[43-df-genmltest]]，$U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}$。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-173","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-genmltest]] — 广义 Martin-Löf 检验"},{"id":"2e434343f51a33e9","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；定义见 [[43-df-weak2random]]、[[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-genmltest]]。"}],"outgoing":["ab1ef7b1cac112c1","7d3f8d3dfdb54f27","8e999d59227f4a28"]}